  "info.dragonrise_reforge.ba10": "The BA-10 is a Soviet heavy armored car of the 1930s: a 6x4 wheeled chassis mounting a 37mm turret. Fast on roads and widely used for reconnaissance and infantry support, though its thin armour means it must rely on mobility and getting the first shot off.",
