  "info.dragonrise_reforge.f14": "",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.f15e": "The F-15E Strike Eagle is a twin-seat, twin-engine all-weather multirole fighter developed by McDonnell Douglas from the F-15 air superiority fighter. Heavily optimized for ground attack with the APG-70 radar and conformal fuel tanks, it earned the nickname \"Bomb Truck\" and serves as the backbone of the USAF\u0027s long-range strike forces.",
