  "info.dragonrise_reforge.shield": "",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.silverhand_mk_iv": "The Silverhand - Mk. IV is the Warden assault tank: a quick-traversing 40mm cannon in the turret backed by a hull-mounted 68mm anti-tank gun, letting it cripple enemy armour with a twin-gun punch in frontal assaults. Heavy front and rear armour shrugs off small arms, shrapnel, 12.7mm machine gun fire and flamethrowers - but its slow hull traverse and exposed flanks demand infantry support. Named after Nuada Airgetlam of Celtic myth.",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.spacebag": "",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.strv103": "",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.su24m": "",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.sx1": "",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.syy651": "",
  "info.dragonrise_reforge.t26b": "The T-26B is the Soviet 1933 model light tank, armed with a 45mm 20-K gun and a coaxial DT machine gun. Built in huge numbers and nimble on the move, its armour only stops rifle fire, making it best used alongside infantry.",
